### Use with the VS Code extension "REST Client" (by Huachao Mao).
### Start the API first:  python m5_03_products_api.py
### Then click "Send Request" above each block.

@base = http://127.0.0.1:5005

### 1. List all products
GET {{base}}/api/products

### 2. Filter by category and price
GET {{base}}/api/products?category=electronics&max_price=1000

### 3. One product
GET {{base}}/api/products/101

### 4. Not found -> 404
GET {{base}}/api/products/999

### 5. Create a product -> 201
POST {{base}}/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{"name": "Yoga Mat", "price": 899, "stock": 30, "category": "fitness"}

### 6. Invalid product -> 422 with details
POST {{base}}/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{"name": "TV", "price": -10, "stock": "many"}

### 7. Partial update (price drop for a sale) -> 200
PATCH {{base}}/api/products/101
Content-Type: application/json

{"price": 699}

### 8. Delete -> 204
DELETE {{base}}/api/products/102

### 9. Unexpected bug -> clean 500 JSON
GET {{base}}/api/crash
